          <span class="lang-en">⚠️ Bundle-id migration: the new app (com.prisma-devs.prisma) does not inherit old app data automatically.</span>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps lang-zh">
          <li>LiveContainer 用户：新版本首次启动的欢迎向导会自动检测旧包名数据，点「一键迁移」即可（推荐）。设置 → 通用也提供常驻「导入旧版启动器数据」入口。</li>
          <li>其他安装：在<b>旧版</b>（air 包名）中导出全量备份 → 新版中导入 → 重启生效。</li>
          <li>数据确认无误后删除旧图标。air 旧包名今后不再发布。</li>
        </ol>
        <ol class="steps lang-en">
          <li>LiveContainer users: the welcome wizard auto-detects legacy-bundle data on first launch — tap "one-tap migrate" (recommended). A permanent "Import old launcher data" entry also lives in Settings → General.</li>
          <li>Other installs: export a full backup from the <b>old</b> (air bundle id) app → import in the new app → restart.</li>
          <li>Remove the old icon once data is verified. The legacy air bundle id will no longer receive releases.</li>
        </ol>
