          <span class="lang-zh">QQ 群 1126547426 · </span><span class="lang-en">QQ group 1126547426 · </span>
          <span class="lang-zh">基于 PojavLauncher / Amethyst 社区成果构建，感谢所有上游贡献者</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Built on PojavLauncher / Amethyst community work — thanks to all upstream contributors</span>
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">© 2026 Prisma Devs · <span class="lang-zh">本页面由 Astro 构建，公告与仓库同步</span><span class="lang-en">Built with Astro; announcements synced from the repo</span></p>
      </div>
